`pytest`, `httpx`).\n- [`pyproject.toml`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/brain/228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457/pyproject.toml): Configured for Python 3.12 requirement (`>=3.12, <3.13`) and pytest settings.\n- [`.gitignore`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/brain/228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457/.gitignore): Standard python gitignore rules.\n- [`README.md`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/brain/228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457/README.md): Comprehensive setup, execution, API reference, and Vercel serverless deployment guide.\n\n---\n\n## 🔬 API & Interface Verification Details\n\n### API Endpoints\n1. `GET /api/health`\n   - **Response**: `{\"status\": \"ok\", \"platform\": \"StreamWave Serverless Media Platform\", \"environment\": \"Vercel Serverless\", \"timestamp\": \"...\"}`\n2. `GET /api/media`\n   - **Parameters**: `query` (search string), `type` (`movie` | `music`), `genre` (`Comedy`, `Drama`, `Action`, `Zimdancehall`, `Afro-pop`, `Traditional`).\n   - **Response**: Array of `MediaItem` objects.\n3. `GET /api/media/{media_id}`\n   - **Response**: Single `MediaItem` or HTTP `404 Not Found` (`{\"detail\": \"Media item not found\"}`).\n4. `POST /api/play-events`\n   - **Body**: `{\"media_id\": \"mov-001\", \"session_id\": \"sess-xyz\", \"client_timestamp\": \"...\"}`\n   - **Response**: HTTP `201 Created` with `{\"status\": \"recorded\", \"event\": {...}}`.\n   - **Logging**: Writes structured JSON event to standard logger (`logger.info(...)`).\n\n---\n\n## 💡 How to Run & Verify Locally\n\n1. **Install Dependencies**:\n   ```bash\n   pip install -r requirements.txt\n   ```\n\n2. **Generate Demo Audio File**:\n   ```bash\n   python scripts/generate_demo_audio.py\n   ```\n\n3. **Run Automated Tests**:\n   ```bash\n   pytest tests/test_api.py -v\n   ```\n\n4. **Launch Local Server**:\n   ```bash\n   uvicorn app:app --reload --host 127.0.0.1 --port 8000\n   ```\n   - Application UI: `http://127.0.0.1:8000`\n   - Swagger Documentation: `http://127.0.0.1:8000/docs`\n","Description":"Create walkthrough artifact documenting created files and testing instructions","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\dell\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457\\walkthrough.md","toolAction":"Creating walkthrough artifact","toolSummary":"Creating walkthrough artifact"}}]}
