{"step_index":50,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-25T15:28:43Z","content":"I have completed the implementation of the **StreamWave Serverless Media Platform** academic prototype for **StreamWave Entertainment** using **Python 3.12** and **FastAPI**, designed for serverless deployment on **Vercel**.\n\n---\n\n### 📂 Files Created\n\n| File Path | Description |\n| :--- | :--- |\n| [`app.py`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/brain/228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457/app.py) | FastAPI application entry point, Pydantic validation models, security headers middleware, `/api` routes, and static file mounting. |\n| [`data/media.json`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/brain/228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457/data/media.json) | Read-only Zimbabwean entertainment catalogue (movies and music). |\n| [`public/index.html`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/brain/228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457/public/index.html) | Semantic HTML5 web interface with StreamWave branding, hero section, search/filter controls, card grid, accessible modal, and audio player. |\n| [`public/css/styles.css`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/brain/228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457/public/css/styles.css) | Dark graphite background (`#121214`), restrained red accent (`#e50914`), clean rectangular cards, and mobile/desktop responsive design. |\n| [`public/js/app.js`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/brain/228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457/public/js/app.js) | Vanilla JS state management, API client, HTML5 audio playback, event logging trigger, accessible modal handling, and UI state views. |\n| [`scripts/generate_demo_audio.py`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/brain/228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457/scripts/generate_demo_audio.py) | Standard-library Python script synthesizing a 3-second PCM 16-bit 44.1kHz mono WAV musical chime (`public/media/demo.wav`). |\n| [`tests/test_api.py`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/brain/228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457/tests/test_api.py) | Pytest automated test suite covering all endpoints, query filtering, detail lookups, 404 responses, and 422 input validation. |\n| [`requirements.txt`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/brain/228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457/requirements.txt) | Pinned dependencies (`fastapi`, `uvicorn`, `pydantic`, `pytest`, `httpx`). |\n| [`pyproject.toml`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/brain/228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457/pyproject.toml) | Environment metadata requiring Python 3.12 (`>=3.12, <3.13`) and pytest settings. |\n| [`.gitignore`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/brain/228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457/.gitignore) | Source control ignore patterns for bytecode, caches, virtual environments, and Vercel build folders. |\n| [`README.md`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/brain/228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457/README.md) | Technical setup guide, local execution instructions, API endpoint reference table, and Vercel deployment notes. |\n| [`walkthrough.md`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/brain/228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457/walkthrough.md) | Summary of completed implementation details and verification instructions. |\n\n---\n\n### 🧪 Tests Executed & Coverage\n\nAutomated tests are implemented in [`tests/test_api.py`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/brain/228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457/tests/test_api.py):\n\n1. `test_health_endpoint`: Verifies `GET /api/health` returns HTTP 200 OK with serverless platform metadata and ISO 8601 server timestamp.\n2. `test_get_complete_media_catalogue`: Verifies `GET /api/media` returns the full catalogue array from `data/media.json`.\n3. `test_media_search_filter`: Verifies searching with `?query=Cook` filters catalogue items matching title/artist/description/genre.\n4. `test_media_type_filter`: Verifies filtering with `?type=movie` and `?type=music` returns strictly matching media types.\n5. `test_media_genre_filter`: Verifies filtering with `?genre=Zimdancehall` returns items matching the specified genre.\n6. `test_get_valid_media_detail`: Verifies `GET /api/media/mov-001` returns HTTP 200 OK with single item metadata.\n7. `test_get_unknown_media_detail_404`: Verifies `GET /api/media/unknown-id-9999` returns HTTP 404 Not Found with error detail.\n8. `test_valid_play_event`: Verifies `POST /api/play-events` with valid `media_id` returns HTTP 201 Created with `status: \"recorded\"`, attaches a server timestamp, and emits a structured JSON log.\n9. `test_play_event_unknown_media_404`: Verifies `POST /api/play-events` with an unknown `media_id` returns HTTP 404 Not Found.\n10. `test_play_event_invalid_body_422`: Verifies `POST /api/play-events` missing required payload fields returns HTTP 422 Unprocessable Entity.\n\n---\n\n### 💻 Local Commands for Running the Application\n\n1. **Install dependencies**:\n   ```bash\n   pip install -r requirements.txt\n   ```\n\n2. **Generate the non-copyrighted audio demonstration file**:\n   ```bash\n   python scripts/generate_demo_audio.py\n   ```\n\n3. **Run automated tests**:\n   ```bash\n   pytest tests/test_api.py -v\n   ```\n\n4. **Launch the local development server**:\n   ```bash\n   uvicorn app:app --reload --host 127.0.0.1 --port 8000\n   ```\n\n- **Web Application UI**: [http://127.0.0.1:8000](http://127.0.0.1:8000)\n- **Automatic Swagger OpenAPI Docs**: [http://127.0.0.1:8000/docs](http://127.0.0.1:8000/docs)\n\n---\n\n### ⚠️ Remaining Limitations\n\n1. **Ephemeral Event Logging**: In accordance with Vercel's read-only serverless execution environment, `POST /api/play-events` logs structured JSON playback events directly to the Python runtime logger rather than persisting them to an external database (e.g. PostgreSQL/MongoDB).\n2. **Audio File Scope**: For academic demonstration compliance and free-tier payload limits, all media items in the prototype point to the synthesized 3-second non-copyrighted WAV audio file (`/media/demo.wav`)."}
